kedNotice:`Eliminated players must spectate until the bunker finale`,btnMinimizeVoting:`Minimize window`,btnOpenVoting:`🗳️ Vote`,btnStickers:`Stickers`,stickersTitle:`Bunker Stickers`,rulesTitle:`GAME RULES:`,rule1:`1. 2 to 5 winning spots (10 players = 3 spots, 11 players = 4 spots, 12 players = 5 spots).`,rule2:`2. Every round you choose 1 card to reveal to prove your value.`,rule3:`3. Secretly vote out the least useful or most dangerous person.`,rule4:`4. If eliminated, you become a Ghost and spy on all secret votes!`,btnAuth:`Login / Register`,authModalTitle:`BUNKER ACCESS TERMINAL`,authContinueGoogle:`Continue with Google`,authContinueAsGoogle:`Continue as`,authGoogleChangeAccount:`Switch Google account`,authGoogleModalTitle:`Sign in with Google`,authGoogleModalSubtitle:`Instant 1-click access • +500 BunCoins bonus`,authGoogleInputLabel:`Your Gmail address or name:`,authGooglePlaceholder:`e.g. alex@gmail.com`,authGoogleBtnSubmit:`Sign in with Google`,authGoogleCancel:`Back`,authGoogleOr:`or with login and password`,authLoginTab:`Sign In`,authRegisterTab:`Register`,authUsername:`Callsign / Username`,authPassword:`Access Code / Password`,authRegisterBonus:`+500 BunCoins bonus on registration!`,authGuestContinue:`Continue as Guest`,authBtnLogin:`LOG IN`,authBtnRegister:`CREATE ACCOUNT`,authLogout:`Sign Out`,shopBtn:`Shop`,shopTitle:`SURVIVOR ARSENAL • BUNCOINS`,shopCoinsBalance:`Your BunCoins balance:`,shopTabCharacters:`Characters`,shopTabFrames:`Profile Frames`,shopTabTitles:`Titles`,shopBtnBuy:`Buy`,shopBtnEquip:`Equip`,shopEquippedBadge:`EQUIPPED`,shopFree:`Free`,adminBtn:`Admin`,adminTitle:`Bunker Control Panel`,adminLoginPrompt:`Enter administrator credentials:`,adminParolPlaceholder:`Password`,adminBtnLogin:`ENTER PANEL`,adminTabProfessions:`Professions`,adminTabHealth:`Health`,adminTabHobbies:`Hobbies`,adminTabLuggage:`Luggage`,adminTabFacts:`Facts`,adminTabSpecials:`Trumps`,adminBtnAddCard:`+ Add New Card`,adminSearchPlaceholder:`Search card database...`,